# 📈 Global COVID‑19 Trends Analysis (SQL Project)

## 🧭 Overview

This project explores worldwide COVID‑19 case, vaccination, and mortality trends using SQL.  
The goal is to demonstrate data wrangling, aggregation, and analytical storytelling entirely through SQL.  

The analysis uncovers how vaccination rates, policy measures, and geography correlated with infections and fatalities between 2020–2023.

---

## 🗂️ Dataset

- **Source:** [Our World in Data – COVID‑19 Dataset](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/owid/covid-19-data)  
- **Public Mirror:** `bigquery-public-data.covid19_open_data`  
- **License:** Open Data Commons Public Domain Dedication (PDDL)  
- **Coverage:** 200+ countries, daily updates, 2020–2023  
- **Main fields:**  
  - `country_name`  
  - `continent`  
  - `date`  
  - `new_confirmed`, `new_deceased`, `new_vaccinations`  
  - `population`, `mobility`, `stringency_index`

