## 🎯 Objectives

1. Analyze global and regional case growth patterns  
2. Rank countries by vaccination progress and case fatality rate  
3. Compute 7‑day rolling averages to smooth daily volatility  
4. Correlate vaccine rollout speed with mortality outcomes  
5. Visualize key insights in BI dashboards  

